    {"id": "gap_analysis_known_limitations", "label": "GAP_ANALYSIS known limitations (intentionally deferred)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "/Users/amirheidari/GitHub/Intelligences-Trader/GAP_ANALYSIS_2026-08-24.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Documented deferrals include the Sharpe risk-free convention, PPO train/serve feature skew (training uses HMM-decoded regime + equity drawdown; ONNX inference uses expanding-quantile volatility regime + price drawdown), unauthenticated /metrics, AUTH_REQUIRED defaulting off outside production, and the npm optional-dependency lockfile bug #4828."},
    {"id": "gap_analysis_divergent_local_history", "label": "GAP_ANALYSIS divergent local history resolved (ca5b02c)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "/Users/amirheidari/GitHub/Intelligences-Trader/GAP_ANALYSIS_2026-08-24.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A parallel local commit ca5b02c (SQLite persistence + real auth) diverged from origin/main; origin/main's PostgreSQL-with-fallback repositories and env-admin JWT were kept as canonical, the local line archived to archive/local-sqlite-auth with nothing ported (SQLite conflicts with the chosen persistence architecture; multi-user scrypt registration needs a product decision)."},
    {"id": "onnx_contract_mismatch", "label": "ONNX artifact contract mismatch (Python 5-in/2-out vs Node 10-in/1-out)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "/Users/amirheidari/GitHub/Intelligences-Trader/FULL_STACK_AUDIT_REPORT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The two shipped ONNX artifacts do not share a contract: the Python research artifact takes 5 features and returns 2 outputs; the Node serving artifact takes 10 features and returns 1. CODE-VERIFIED by ml_service/test_model_contract.py and robot trader/server/modelArtifactContract.test.js; unresolved — one artifact must be rebuilt and promoted."},
    {"id": "ppo_action_space_mismatch", "label": "PPO action-space mismatch (continuous direction vs discrete action)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "/Users/amirheidari/GitHub/Intelligences-Trader/FULL_STACK_AUDIT_REPORT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The PPO action space differs between services: the Python policy emits a continuous direction while the Node environment decodes a discrete action. CODE-VERIFIED as a known defect; one shared action contract is still missing."},
    {"id": "no_broker_oms", "label": "No broker/OMS implementation (live-trading P0)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "/Users/amirheidari/GitHub/Intelligences-Trader/FULL_STACK_AUDIT_REPORT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "There is deliberately no authenticated order state machine, idempotency key, reconciliation, partial-fill handling, cancel/replace flow, or disaster recovery. ASPIRATIONAL — no code claims to provide it."},
    {"id": "model_governance_incomplete", "label": "Model governance incomplete (signed model card/promotion)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "/Users/amirheidari/GitHub/Intelligences-Trader/FULL_STACK_AUDIT_REPORT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tracked ONNX artifacts still lack a signed model card, exact dataset hash, feature schema, scaler parameters, training commit, validation report, and promotion/rollback record. CODE-VERIFIED that the artifacts exist and are pinned (names, shapes, SHA-256); the governance artefacts are still missing."},
